Display a 2×2 decimal matrix:  
\[
\left\{
\begin{array}{cc}
3.46 & 2.12 \\
33.22 & 12.00 \\
\end{array}
\right\}
\]  
Each element is rounded to two decimal places, and the matrix is enclosed in curly braces. It appears on screen without animation.

